repository-code: "https://github.com/QihuanXie/seymour-second-neighbourhood"
abstract: >-
  A short, self-contained and purely combinatorial proof of Seymour's
  second-neighbourhood conjecture, together with a Lean 4 formalization of
  all numbered results of the paper. The main ingredient is a deletion lemma
  for two families of ordered pairs, proved by an induction driven by Hall's
  defect theorem, with greedy matchings and double counting in the saturated
  case.
